1. PUBLIC SHOWCASE VS. PROTECTED SOURCE VAULT ARCHITECTURE
================================================================================

This public repository (`https://github.com/annoris/valtor`) operates strictly
as an **Official Architecture Showcase, Technical Specification & Live
Demonstration** for the **VALTOR — V9 Aquila Digital Flagship**.

The complete, editable production source code—including the unminified modular
ES2022+ `src/` architecture, custom dependency-free `SplitText` engine, Lenis +
GSAP `ScrollTrigger` choreography controllers, bespoke SVG monogram kits, and
high-resolution raw studio assets—is housed in the private commercial vault
repository:

  Private Source Vault: `https://github.com/annoris/valtor-pro-source`

Access to the full editable source code in `annoris/valtor-pro-source` is
exclusively unlocked for verified contributors, studio licensees, and enterprise
patrons who settle their contribution or license fee on-chain via the official
Solana (SOL / SPL-USDC) treasury wallet:

  Official Solana Treasury Wallet:
